How the methods were tested
───────────────────────────
  Assets      US Equity, Intl Equity, Bonds, Gold and Real Estate; T-Bills as
              cash. Monthly returns, Nov 1996 to Oct 2026.
  Validation  Walk-forward: refitted at each rebalance on all the history so far
              (first 120 months), scored on Nov 2006 to Oct 2026.
  Limits      Fully invested and long only.
  Trading     Rebalanced yearly, 10 bp trading costs.
  Ratios      Against the T-Bills return, 1.7% a year over the test; value at
              risk and expected shortfall from history, at 95% over one month.

